# Protagonist, top-down sheet in the RPG Maker MV/MZ single-character layout
# ("$" prefix = one character per file): 3 columns (step, stand, step) x
# 4 rows (down, left, right, up). ACTION GAME MAKER G imports this layout.
# Left/right reuse the side-view frames so both views stay consistent.
# 24x32 cells (the RPG Maker 2000 cell size).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 24 32
@output ../characters/$protagonist_topdown.png
@preview ../previews/protagonist_topdown_x6.png 6
@columns 3

# side frame frozen from the old protagonist_side.pix (idle_0) in art v2
